## Finding your week

<ol class="chunked-list">
<li>Open <strong>Schedule Timeline</strong>.</li>
<li>Pick your name in the <strong>Technician</strong> dropdown.</li>
<li>Click any bar to see the job, dates and job notes.</li>
</ol>

## What the colors mean

- Each technician has their own color.
- **Gray** means someone is **Out**. The reason is private and isn't shown.
- **Half Day** on an assignment means the day is split between two sites. You'll see both.

## Something looks wrong?

Tell the supervisor. Don't work from an old copy of the spreadsheet; this schedule is the only current version.
